{
 "meta": {
  "name": "units_helpers",
  "note": "Hand-written: the helpers of the units family that v1's corpora test only through other functions. dimension_out_of_range and dec_sign by hand; is_pos_finite from CPython's float(), which is v1's definition of the test (a positive decimal whose nearest double is positive and finite), including the exact halfway points 2^-1075 and 2^1024 - 2^970, which round to zero and to infinity."
 },
